

Core data model

AtomOp: primitive operation or structureFields: name, type (bit_op, word_op, sbox, group, rng), params

Construction: how atoms are wired (SPN, Feistel, sponge, stream, key schedule, mode)Fields: kind, block_size, key_size, rounds, round_steps[]

Scheme: full cipher/hash/MAC/KDF/protocolFields: name, constructions[], mode, key_derivation, profile

Policy: meta‑rules and weightsFields: target_security_bits, perf_target, side_channel_profile, weights

SimResult: analyzed stateFields: security_estimate, latency, throughput, footprint, risk, notes

Pipeline

Author blueprint (DSL):

cipher CMB_AES_LIKE {
  primitive: SPN;
  block_size: 128;
  key_size: 256;

  round {
    sub_bytes(SBOX_CMB);
    shift_rows(pattern = spiral);
    mix_columns(matrix = M_CMB);
    add_round_key(schedule = K_CMB);
  }

  mode: GCM;
  profile: CMB_BALANCED;
}

